{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"1636440","name":"SILENT HILL: Townfall","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >西蒙·奥德尔被唤回圣阿米莉亚岛，只求能“让一切重回正轨”。眼前的小镇静立于浓雾之下，看似荒废，实则异动暗生。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >西蒙试图理解自己与这片土地及其居民的联系。随着调查步步深入，过去的记忆残片逐渐浮出水面。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏全程采用第一人称视角，西蒙必须凭借有限的武器和工具完成探索，在危险逼近时顺利脱身，活到最后。工具中有一台 CRTV 便携电视，能够接收到某些不稳定信号。逃生过程惊险刺激，战斗体验极尽疯狂。叙事驱动的谜题下，藏着呼之欲出的真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《SILENT HILL: Townfall》是一款完整独立的心理恐怖游戏。玩家将深入 1996 年的苏格兰，切身感受扑面而来的冷寂氛围。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >探索 1996 年的圣阿米莉亚</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >雾气弥漫的街道串起遗落的街区，每个被忘却的角落都通过独特的氛围与历史诉说着自己的故事。现实与幻象在此悄然交织，吸引着玩家一步步迈入圣阿米莉亚，一个真实到仿佛触手可及的神秘世界。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/extras/5de9cd73f11c38350b7b759772e463d2.poster.avif?t=1789974011\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/extras/5de9cd73f11c38350b7b759772e463d2.webm?t=1789974011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/extras/5de9cd73f11c38350b7b759772e463d2.mp4?t=1789974011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >新篇故事，一眼难忘</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《SILENT HILL: Townfall》的舞台坐落在苏格兰雾气笼罩的街道景致之间，一段独一无二、扣人心弦的故事就此启幕。“恐怖”之外，更关乎“自省”、“失去”和“后果”。惧意于细微处滋生——总有一些瞬间寂静到让人心慌，西蒙的过去投下挥之不去的阴影，愈来愈长。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/extras/631f523d67483f94fd7102e28a137caf.poster.avif?t=1789974011\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/extras/631f523d67483f94fd7102e28a137caf.webm?t=1789974011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/extras/631f523d67483f94fd7102e28a137caf.mp4?t=1789974011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >前行战斗，策略为先</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在激烈缠斗中利用近战武器攻击、格挡，或是保持距离，靠枪械保命。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >分析手头工具和周边环境，随机应变，巧妙处理每场遭遇战。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >战和逃之外，往往还有别的选项。可以潜行避开危险，躲在掩体后面追踪敌人的位置，或是声东击西，将他们引开。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/extras/066d1554be7304a81a4f3c56fb6cc120.poster.avif?t=1789974011\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/extras/066d1554be7304a81a4f3c56fb6cc120.webm?t=1789974011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/extras/066d1554be7304a81a4f3c56fb6cc120.mp4?t=1789974011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >叙事谜题，CRTV 引导</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《寂静岭》系列中标志性的收音机重磅回归，只是这次的形态是 CRTV，一款便携电视设备。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >附近潜伏的威胁、可供收集的故事片段以及神秘线索，正通过断断续续的模拟信号飘荡而来。只需适当调谐 CRTV，就能统统捕捉到。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >种种叙事驱动的谜题都和这些片段息息相关，玩家可以重温此地发生过的种种事件，一窥小镇的日常生活，时刻把握剧情主线。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/extras/7c27d8f0068c3cd253fba9850fa41757.poster.avif?t=1789974011\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/extras/7c27d8f0068c3cd253fba9850fa41757.webm?t=1789974011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/extras/7c27d8f0068c3cd253fba9850fa41757.mp4?t=1789974011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >第一人称，沉浸体验</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这是首款采用第一人称视角的《寂静岭》系列完整作品，玩家将代入西蒙，亲身探索这座浓雾笼罩的小镇。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >能见度受限，对危险的感知也更为敏锐——在这样的条件下，潜行、战斗、探索和使用 CRTV 的代入感会更强，恐惧也更加深入人心。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/extras/6c9d3e4e99d865633bb6fe63e60566cd.poster.avif?t=1789974011\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/extras/6c9d3e4e99d865633bb6fe63e60566cd.webm?t=1789974011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/extras/6c9d3e4e99d865633bb6fe63e60566cd.mp4?t=1789974011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >多重结局，任君体验</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >行动决定着剧情的走向，当故事画上句点，情感的余波仍久久不能散去。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >声效加音乐，共同营造紧张感</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >伴着一声声吱呀、信号音与尖叫，危险逐渐逼近耳畔，而富有创意的音效设计则营造出丰富而令人毛骨悚然的声景。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilotpriest 创作的全动态配乐会随着玩家和敌人的行动而层层铺陈，实时响应战斗与潜行的起承转合，营造出张弛有度的紧张氛围。</p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/0ed1cb4bc30631f95b92f7f13bb06c15d49b4afa/header.jpg?t=1789974011","website":"https://www.konami.com/games/silenthill/townfall/","developers":["Screen Burn"],"publishers":["KONAMI"," Annapurna Interactive"],"release_date":"2026 年 9 月 23 日","coming_soon":true,"price":{"currency":"USD","initial":"49.99","final":"49.99","discount":0},"supported_languages":"英语<strong>*</strong>, 法语, 意大利语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 西班牙语 - 拉丁美洲, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 波兰语, 俄语, 简体中文, 繁体中文, 日语<strong>*</strong>, 韩语<br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","Steam 成就","完全支持控制器","视角舒适度","自定义音量控制","可调整难度","推荐使用手柄","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","立体声","字幕选项","Steam 云","家庭共享"],"genres":["动作","冒险"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 / Intel i7-8700K<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 Super / AMD Radeon RX 6600<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 75 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>声卡:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> Playing on minimum requirements should enable to play on Low settings at 1080p 30fps.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 5700X / Intel i7-9700K<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 / AMD Radeon RX 7800 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 75 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>声卡:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> Playing on recommended requirements should enable play on High settings at 4K 30fps (using DLSS,FSR or TSR Balanced mode).</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/c6ae9fc8011c59932651baa3d45709ef0df69cb0/ss_c6ae9fc8011c59932651baa3d45709ef0df69cb0.600x338.jpg?t=1789974011","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/c6ae9fc8011c59932651baa3d45709ef0df69cb0/ss_c6ae9fc8011c59932651baa3d45709ef0df69cb0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789974011"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/9546770d94919d74d3867d218a66b58a0bd5cc6b/ss_9546770d94919d74d3867d218a66b58a0bd5cc6b.600x338.jpg?t=1789974011","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/9546770d94919d74d3867d218a66b58a0bd5cc6b/ss_9546770d94919d74d3867d218a66b58a0bd5cc6b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789974011"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/870894c942a3de88f35773657cee1fb0009e9a16/ss_870894c942a3de88f35773657cee1fb0009e9a16.600x338.jpg?t=1789974011","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1636440/870894c942a3de88f35773657cee1fb0009e9a16/ss_870894c942a3de88f35773657cee1fb0009e9a16.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789974011"}]}